            <h3 style="font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:24px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#1B1810;">The code you never chose</h3>
            <p style="font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#56524A;margin-bottom:16px;">Your LOS was written early and rarely questioned since. We help you see it, challenge it, and rewrite it to match the leader you mean to be.</p>
            <a href={SLUGS.goldenBuddha} style="margin-top:auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#C04A26;text-decoration:none;" onmouseover="this.querySelector('span').style.transform='translateX(4px)'" onmouseout="this.querySelector('span').style.transform='translateX(0)'">Read: The Golden Buddha <span style="transition:transform .2s;">&rarr;</span></a>
          </div>
          <div style="background:#F4F0E7;padding:34px 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
            <p style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A7F6C;margin-bottom:14px;">The ABCs</p>
            <h3 style="font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:24px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#1B1810;">Awareness · Beliefs · Courage</h3>
            <p style="font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#56524A;margin-bottom:16px;">Control your Awareness. Build your Beliefs. Harness your Courage. You can't outperform your current mindset — so we shift it, one workout at a time.</p>
            <a href={SLUGS.mindset} style="margin-top:auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#C04A26;text-decoration:none;" onmouseover="this.querySelector('span').style.transform='translateX(4px)'" onmouseout="this.querySelector('span').style.transform='translateX(0)'">Read: The Mindset of a Legend <span style="transition:transform .2s;">&rarr;</span></a>
          </div>
          <div style="background:#F4F0E7;padding:34px 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
            <p style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A7F6C;margin-bottom:14px;">Roadmap to Legendary</p>
            <h3 style="font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:24px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#1B1810;">Emerge · Explore · Evolve · Endow</h3>
            <p style="font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#56524A;margin-bottom:16px;">Step beyond your shell, live outside it, leave it behind — and build a legacy larger than yourself. It's why the snail is our mark.</p>
            <a href={SLUGS.roadmap} style="margin-top:auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#C04A26;text-decoration:none;" onmouseover="this.querySelector('span').style.transform='translateX(4px)'" onmouseout="this.querySelector('span').style.transform='translateX(0)'">Read: The Roadmap to Legendary <span style="transition:transform .2s;">&rarr;</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ MINDSET WORKOUTS — the content home ============ -->
    <section id="workouts" style="background:#EFE8DA;color:#1B1810;padding:112px 32px;">
