          <p style="margin-top:20px;font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#56524A;max-width:44ch;">Every Mindset Workout is a short video, its purpose, a story that lands the point, reflection questions, and a personal Misogi challenge to take into the real world. Do one, and you've begun. Give us an email and we'll send you a Mindset Workout to begin your personal Shakubuku.</p>
