            <span style="position:absolute;bottom:14px;left:14px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;color:#B7AE9C;background:rgba(21,19,14,0.8);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;">video slot — Moneyball clip</span>
