            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><span style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E0744A;">Workout 01 · Go For It</span><span style="font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.06em;color:#8C8473;text-transform:uppercase;">Courage · ~10 min</span></div>
            <h3 style="font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:26px;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:16px;color:#FBF8F1;">When was the last time you <em style="font-style:italic;color:#E0744A;">truly</em> went for it?</h3>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;">
              <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;"><span style="font-size:12px;color:#8C8473;font-family:'Newsreader',serif;flex:none;width:64px;">Purpose</span><span style="font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(244,240,231,0.82);">Courage — the C in the ABCs.</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;"><span style="font-size:12px;color:#8C8473;font-family:'Newsreader',serif;flex:none;width:64px;">Story</span><span style="font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(244,240,231,0.82);">Jeremy hits the home run — and trips rounding the bases.</span></div>
