          <p style="margin-top:22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.62;color:#56524A;max-width:52ch;">For twenty-five years James has stood in front of leaders — from founders to the executive teams of $3B companies — and created the moment their self-image changes. He co-authored <em style="font-style:italic;">Discover Your Inner Strength</em> alongside Stephen Covey, Ken Blanchard, Deepak Chopra and Brian Tracy, and is the sole author of the forthcoming <em style="font-style:italic;">Lost Disciplines of Leadership</em>. His work has been featured on CNN, CNN Money and Business Insider.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:20px;font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;color:#C04A26;max-width:44ch;">"Think you don't have a shell? I call bullshit. I have one too. We all do — and you get only what you're willing to commit."</p>
          <div style="margin-top:26px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;">
            <span style="font-size:13px;border:1px solid rgba(27,24,16,0.18);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;color:#56524A;">Co-author w/ Covey, Blanchard, Chopra &amp; Tracy</span>
            <span style="font-size:13px;border:1px solid rgba(27,24,16,0.18);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;color:#56524A;">25 years developing leaders</span>
            <span style="font-size:13px;border:1px solid rgba(27,24,16,0.18);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;color:#56524A;">CNN · Business Insider</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
